<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>IndieHOT 独立游戏热点</title><link>https://staroltest.github.io/indie-game-hot/</link><description>IndieHOT 每天从一批独立游戏信源里收动态，按规则打分精选：引擎与工具、发行与宣发、开发日志、行业与融资、展会与活动、评测与复盘。只显示标题、一句自己写简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:07:53 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>itch 一周游戏汇：11月2日-11月8日（下）</title><link>https://indienova.com/indie-game-news/itch-new-games-summary-of-last-week-2026-1102-1108-part2</link><description>indienova 盘点了 11 月 2 日至 8 日上架 itch.io 的新游戏下半部分，含多款用 Godot 开发的独立作品，适合想找灵感或参考玩法的开发者翻一翻。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:08:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0b6507f925a39770a9122afa574bbb7f68cce34f</guid><source url="https://indienova.com/indie-game-news/itch-new-games-summary-of-last-week-2026-1102-1108-part2">indienova 独立精神</source></item><item><title>我如何在 Pixel 9 Pro 上为六骰策略游戏打造了一个“象棋引擎”式 AI</title><link>https://dev.to/russell_munn_5ab594df99db/how-i-built-a-chess-engine-style-ai-for-a-6-dice-strategy-game-natively-on-my-pixel-9-pro-5abi</link><description>独立开发者在手机上从零搭建六骰桌游的 AI 对手，用类似象棋引擎的概率模拟取代固定套路，还让 AI 读懂对手记分牌来动态调整冒险程度。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:23:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">07c83bf2563dbce3f087b3432ecc969dd9c4d022</guid><source url="https://dev.to/russell_munn_5ab594df99db/how-i-built-a-chess-engine-style-ai-for-a-6-dice-strategy-game-natively-on-my-pixel-9-pro-5abi">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>6 行 JS 屏幕震动加顿帧技巧，立刻提升游戏打击感</title><link>https://dev.to/goutam_lambu_0a07d682a4ee/add-instant-game-feel-with-this-6-line-js-screen-shake-hit-stop-trick-3paj</link><description>不用物理引擎，只要在渲染循环里加 6 行画布平移震动代码，就能让 2D HTML5 浏览器游戏的打击和碰撞立刻有街机般的分量。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:54:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">86d004ea67c2e49ac461f05ff4972fa872cbb325</guid><source url="https://dev.to/goutam_lambu_0a07d682a4ee/add-instant-game-feel-with-this-6-line-js-screen-shake-hit-stop-trick-3paj">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>把整套游戏配装塞进 URL 片段，并盖上它所属的补丁版本戳</title><link>https://dev.to/edinamar_luce_770f4831715/fitting-a-whole-game-build-into-a-url-fragment-stamped-with-the-patch-it-was-made-for-o29</link><description>一位开发者分享了如何把包含职业、技能与天赋点的完整配装用位打包压进很短的 URL 片段，以及如何让旧链接标明版本、提醒哪些部分可能被后续补丁改坏。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 20:42:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e771617671799460c1a6221de14a3bb485c943d1</guid><source url="https://dev.to/edinamar_luce_770f4831715/fitting-a-whole-game-build-into-a-url-fragment-stamped-with-the-patch-it-was-made-for-o29">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>藏在 README 里的二十一点牌桌，由 GitHub Actions 发牌</title><link>https://dev.to/kanywst/a-blackjack-table-that-lives-in-a-readme-dealt-by-github-actions-5g63</link><description>用 issue 下注、workflow 读牌、README 重绘牌面，把经典的 README 小游戏玩法搬到了二十一点上。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:45:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f979d3112aaa54861723cacbb179affcef2d8206</guid><source url="https://dev.to/kanywst/a-blackjack-table-that-lives-in-a-readme-dealt-by-github-actions-5g63">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Roblox Studio 新 Beta：用文字提示生成 R15 动画，还能把旧 R6 动画转成 R15</title><link>https://dev.to/tora_scripts/roblox-dropped-a-studio-beta-that-generates-r15-animations-from-text-prompts-and-converts-old-r6-13og</link><description>Roblox 在 Studio Assistant 里上线了文字生成动画的 Beta 功能：输入动作与情绪描述即可生成最长 10 秒的 R15 人形动画，还能用神经网络把旧 R6 动画升级为 R15，适合不想从零手 K 关键帧的独立开发者。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 05:25:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e75f7e9f19ff2aa99dc815e801e130b1094469d9</guid><source url="https://dev.to/tora_scripts/roblox-dropped-a-studio-beta-that-generates-r15-animations-from-text-prompts-and-converts-old-r6-13og">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>用 Rive 打造游戏化健身吉祥物：开发者指南</title><link>https://dev.to/uianimation/how-to-build-a-gamified-fitness-mascot-with-rive-a-developers-guide-45hp</link><description>这篇教程讲如何用 Rive 状态机做一只会随进度进化、对锻炼做出反应的互动健身吉祥物，并给出 React Native 与 Flutter 的接入做法。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:45:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">6dae86aed95865dd5711080c208c3a0a4ac3efd6</guid><source url="https://dev.to/uianimation/how-to-build-a-gamified-fitness-mascot-with-rive-a-developers-guide-45hp">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>我们如何让 Telegram 小游戏的战斗确定化且由服务器校验</title><link>https://dev.to/codiologism/how-we-made-battles-deterministic-and-server-verified-in-a-telegram-mini-game-26l2</link><description>Seraph Legion 团队分享了他们在 Telegram 小程序里实现确定性战斗的做法：客户端只发意图、服务器决定结果并重放校验，起因是一次刷资源漏洞让他们意识到绝不能信任客户端计算。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 09:52:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">09e2ce0ebab304ae72ce022ed516eb1df1b2303c</guid><source url="https://dev.to/codiologism/how-we-made-battles-deterministic-and-server-verified-in-a-telegram-mini-game-26l2">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>日本 GCC 工程实践：优化 Unity WebGL / Emscripten JS 桥接（零拷贝文件系统与无分支查找）</title><link>https://dev.to/therichmodernmagician/engineered-in-japan-gcc-optimizing-unity-webgl-emscripten-js-bridge-zero-copy-fs-branchless-4n32</link><description>这篇技术报告拆解了 Unity WebGL 游戏里浏览器与引擎之间的 JS 桥接瓶颈，用零拷贝文件系统和无分支查找把内存占用与 CPU 负载降了下来，适合想做网页端发行的开发者参考。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:16:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">618a990fbe981dd0b278d5d5ebcd353ab373970f</guid><source url="https://dev.to/therichmodernmagician/engineered-in-japan-gcc-optimizing-unity-webgl-emscripten-js-bridge-zero-copy-fs-branchless-4n32">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>如何用免费套餐发布刚做好的游戏——7000 名玩家与一个挂掉的数据库带来的教训</title><link>https://dev.to/virtuarian/how-to-publish-the-game-you-just-built-on-free-tiers-lessons-from-7000-players-and-one-dead-3ail</link><description>作者复盘自己用免费云服务发布游戏的经历：排行榜、服务器与账单该怎么安排，以及数据库挂掉时学到的教训。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:28:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">7180f648159370fc0d27dbc5ec785f447c0f1200</guid><source url="https://dev.to/virtuarian/how-to-publish-the-game-you-just-built-on-free-tiers-lessons-from-7000-players-and-one-dead-3ail">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>我用 Twine 做了一款文字恐怖游戏，以及下次会怎么做不同</title><link>https://dev.to/rudy_goes_8411f537b584741/how-i-made-a-text-horror-game-in-twine-and-what-id-do-differently-1mk9</link><description>一位数据分析师分享用 Twine 与 SugarCube 独立完成文字恐怖游戏《FINAL CUT》的经验，包括分支叙事、状态与音效的实现与复盘。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:52:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">a0bab37982a31bc8edf123da8f53514a610a8865</guid><source url="https://dev.to/rudy_goes_8411f537b584741/how-i-made-a-text-horror-game-in-twine-and-what-id-do-differently-1mk9">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>如何给手游应用瘦身：一份实用指南</title><link>https://dev.to/aplusgamesstudio/how-to-reduce-mobile-game-app-size-a-practical-guide-10ie</link><description>先测再砍：贴图通常是手游体积的大头，其次是音频与模型，文章给出逐项压缩与取舍的实操方法。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b8ac34a92aae50885ab55243a4b375950e479292</guid><source url="https://dev.to/aplusgamesstudio/how-to-reduce-mobile-game-app-size-a-practical-guide-10ie">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>BOXERBOTS 招募志愿开发者：UE5 第一人称多人机器人格斗游戏</title><link>https://gamedev.net/forums/topic/720842-boxerbots-looking-for-volunteer-game-developers</link><description>开发者用 Unreal Engine 5.8 做第一人称多人机器人格斗游戏 BOXERBOTS，正在招募志愿者加入团队，适合想参与多人项目练手的开发者留意。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:50:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f5577d45f4a221dd63c2e642162b85012c1c7608</guid><source url="https://gamedev.net/forums/topic/720842-boxerbots-looking-for-volunteer-game-developers">GameDev.net</source></item><item><title>打造 Meu Acervo 3D：一个面向 3D 创作者的开源资源中心</title><link>https://dev.to/lucas_oliveira_d1efc2dbeb/building-meu-acervo-3d-an-open-source-hub-for-3d-creators-7c3</link><description>聚合 Sketchfab、Poly Haven 等多个素材库的开源项目，还附带给创作者用的小工具。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:47:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">032756982a0cba664dedad2c6679da6c1bcdaabc</guid><source url="https://dev.to/lucas_oliveira_d1efc2dbeb/building-meu-acervo-3d-an-open-source-hub-for-3d-creators-7c3">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>发售第一款游戏，我学到了什么</title><link>https://dev.to/maciahtohmas/what-i-learned-shipping-my-first-game-338h</link><description>一位退伍后单人开发《Samurai Vengeance》的开发者，复盘发售后才暴露的盲区，比如高刷屏上游戏速度翻倍，以及真正改变他工作方式的几条教训。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:50:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e1cd0f9e9ea12a18d2cf34d961ce0a392237d9da</guid><source url="https://dev.to/maciahtohmas/what-i-learned-shipping-my-first-game-338h">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Godot 4：沿路径均匀布点（77 个缝线孔）</title><link>https://dev.to/hssolution/godot-4-evenly-spaced-points-along-a-path-77-stitch-holes-1p03</link><description>作者在做皮革工艺游戏时发现，沿折线每隔固定距离布点看似简单，拐角处却会扎堆甚至重合，文章拆解了逐段取整、短线段和重复连接点这三个坑并给出修正思路。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 19:07:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">df1788e541ff779bcc682fa14c6eed831d4210fe</guid><source url="https://dev.to/hssolution/godot-4-evenly-spaced-points-along-a-path-77-stitch-holes-1p03">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>放置类游戏的成长，核心问题其实是“够得着”</title><link>https://dev.to/idlecultivation/idle-game-progression-is-mostly-a-question-of-reach-3e72</link><description>作者用三十次提交复盘放置类游戏的边界设计：高阶资源节点为何必须让低等级玩家够不着，以及三条生命线如何决定一场战斗何时结束。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 20:00:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">c2d3e33f3891ee60aacab8ed24fbceb9db0fb986</guid><source url="https://dev.to/idlecultivation/idle-game-progression-is-mostly-a-question-of-reach-3e72">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>我做了个坦克机器人，在家胜率 83.8%，一到公开赛就被教做人</title><link>https://dev.to/aralie/i-built-a-tank-bot-that-wins-838-at-home-and-gets-humbled-in-public-3c5h</link><description>作者为 AI 编程智能体打造的坦克对战竞技场 battle.training 写了个 JavaScript 控制器，在家胜率 83.8%，公开对战却被打回原形，复盘了本地调参与真实对抗之间的落差。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 20:14:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2c2e655455a5af7f148d8fbcc1eafb4d5644dfbb</guid><source url="https://dev.to/aralie/i-built-a-tank-bot-that-wins-838-at-home-and-gets-humbled-in-public-3c5h